{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "阅卷机",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 82.6,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "零知识证明，是让验证者相信一个计算结果正确，不用自己重算，也看不到计算的秘密输入。",
   "spoken": "零知识证明，是让验证者相信一个计算结果正确，不用自己虫算，也看不到计算的秘密输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 3.192,
   "speechEnd": 10.563
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "要证明的计算，先写成一组数学约束，叫电路。",
   "spoken": "要证明的计算，先写成一组数学约束，叫电路。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 11.0,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 11.0,
   "speechEnd": 15.272
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "满足全部约束的输入，才算正确。",
   "spoken": "满足全部约束的输入，才算正确。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 15.7,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 15.7,
   "speechEnd": 18.083
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "证明器在链下，按电路生成证明。",
   "spoken": "证明器在链下，按电路生成证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 18.48,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 18.58,
   "speechEnd": 21.393
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "验证器在链上，检查证明是不是满足这个电路。",
   "spoken": "验证器在链上，检查证明是不是满足这个电路。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 21.82,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 21.82,
   "speechEnd": 26.093
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "有些方案，开工前要先做一次可信设置，生成证明用的参数。",
   "spoken": "有些方案，开工前要先做一次可信设置，生成证明用的参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 26.52,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 26.613,
   "speechEnd": 31.465
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "最后，业务合约按证明里的公开输入，去结算。",
   "spoken": "最后，业务合约按证明里的公开输入，去结算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 31.86,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 31.86,
   "speechEnd": 35.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "电路、设置、证明器、验证器、结算，任何一环都可能出错。",
   "spoken": "电路、设置、证明器、验证器、结算，任何一环都可能出错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 36.0,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 36.093,
   "speechEnd": 41.526
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 41.98,
   "dur": 0.8,
   "speechStart": 42.08,
   "speechEnd": 42.568
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "考试的阅卷机，只核对答题卡上的格子，是不是按规则涂满。",
   "spoken": "考试的阅倦机，只核对答题卡上的格子，是不是按规则涂满。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 43.0,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 43.096,
   "speechEnd": 47.903
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "如果出题人漏写了一条，第 5 题只能涂一个格子。",
   "spoken": "如果出题人漏写了一条，第 5 题只能涂一个格子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 48.34,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 48.431,
   "speechEnd": 52.363
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "考生把第 5 题的 4 个格子全涂上，阅卷机照样判对。",
   "spoken": "考生把第 5 题的 4 个格子全涂上，阅倦机照样判对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 52.8,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 52.8,
   "speechEnd": 57.563
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "阅卷机没坏，是规则漏了一条。",
   "spoken": "阅倦机没坏，是规则漏了一条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 57.98,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 57.98,
   "speechEnd": 60.298
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的电路有成千上万条约束。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的电路有成千上万条约束。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 60.68,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 60.785,
   "speechEnd": 65.121
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "漏写一条，从外面看不出任何异常，只能靠审计、形式化验证和测试去找。",
   "spoken": "漏写一条，从外面看不出任何异常，只能靠审计、形式化验证和测试去找。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 65.54,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 65.636,
   "speechEnd": 71.972
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "所以记住一句话。",
   "spoken": "所以记住一句话。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 72.32,
   "dur": 1.52,
   "speechStart": 72.32,
   "speechEnd": 73.654
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "验证器只检查证明是否满足电路，不检查电路是否写对。",
   "spoken": "验证器只检查证明是否满足电路，不检查电路是否写对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 74.06,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 74.06,
   "speechEnd": 79.067
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "先看出题这一关，电路。",
   "spoken": "先看出题这一关，电路。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
